      "question": "How to pull yourself out of a depressive episode?",
      "type": "ai_overview",
      "text_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "snippet": "To pull yourself out of a depressive episode, focus on a combination of self-care, professional help, and lifestyle adjustments. Engage in activities you enjoy, maintain social connections, and prioritize physical health through exercise and healthy eating. Consider seeking therapy or medication, and be patient with the process, as recovery takes time.",
          "snippet_highlighted_words": [
