          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "snippet": "Here's a more detailed breakdown:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "snippet": "1. Seek Professional Help:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "list": [
            {
              "title": "Therapy:",
              "snippet": "Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) and Interpersonal Therapy (IPT) are effective treatments that can help you understand and manage your thoughts and behaviors, and improve your relationships.",
